---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Toolblip"
  description="Toolblip privacy policy. All tools run client-side in your browser. No data is collected or transmitted."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: April 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-gray-300">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">No data leaves your browser</h2>
        <p>
          Every tool on Toolblip runs entirely in your browser using JavaScript. Text, files, images,
          and any other inputs you provide are processed locally on your device. Nothing is sent to
          our servers or any third party.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Analytics (optional)</h2>
        <p>
          With your consent, we use Google Analytics 4 to understand which tools are used and how
          traffic reaches the site. This collects anonymized usage data (page views, approximate
          location by country, browser type). No personal data is sold or shared. You can decline
          analytics via the cookie banner — the site works fully without it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We store a single preference key (<code class="text-green-400 text-sm">tb_consent</code>)
          in localStorage to remember your analytics choice. No tracking cookies are set without
          your consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">No account required</h2>
        <p>
          Toolblip does not require registration. We do not collect names, email addresses, or any
          personally identifying information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may log request metadata (IP address,
          user agent) for security and network purposes, governed by
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" class="text-green-400 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@toolblip.com" class="text-green-400 hover:underline">privacy@toolblip.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
